-end=\"463\">Material:</strong> High-quality hardened steel with ergonomic plastic handles</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"683\">\n<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"542\"><strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"540\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"683\">\n<li data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"595\">\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"595\">Precision stripping without damaging the fiber</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"633\">\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"633\">Smooth action for easy handling</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"683\">\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"683\">Non-slip, comfortable grip for extended use</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"ETOPEL ET-A03 Fiber Stripper","href":"/etopel-et-a03-fiber-stripper","now":"1,300৳","old":"1,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Signal Fire Mc-16 Fiber Stripper Multi-Functions with Fiber Cleaver","href":"/signal-fire-mc-16-fiber-stripper-multi-functions-with-fiber-cleaver","now":"25,000৳","old":"27,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Signal Fire ZSQ-09 New 9 in 1 Optical Fiber Stripper Optic Miller Scissors Wire Pliers","href":"/signal-fire-zsq-09-new-9-in-1-optical-fiber-stripper-optic-miller-scissors-wire-pliers","now":"2,500৳","old":"2,750৳","single":""},{"name":"ZTI Tri-hole Fiber Optic Stripper","href":"/zti-tri-hole-fiber-optic-stripper","now":"","old":"","single":"1,000৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":null,"tags":{"title":"Tags:","links":[{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=tawaa%20ft11301t","text":"tawaa ft11301t"},{"href":"/index.php?route=product/search&tag=fiber%20optic%20stripper%20bangladesh","text":"fiber optic stripper bangladesh"},{"href":"/index.php?